{
  "name": "New local businesses from Google Maps to Google Sheets (lead gen)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New local businesses from Google Maps to Google Sheets (lead gen)\n\nEvery Monday, find businesses that newly appeared on Google Maps for your searches (e.g. 'dentists in Miami') and add them - name, phone, website, address, rating - to a Google Sheet. Built for agencies that sell to new businesses.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Find new Google Maps businesses** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Find new Google Maps businesses** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** pay per new business found; the first monitored run stores a free baseline. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/google-maps-new-business-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "f180bafd-5a2f-4483-b763-d28ab219fba1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
